<mxCell id="j15" value="Here simulation and verification are the same function. The sim-to-real gap remains: perfect in CARLA and wrong on a real road; a tool policy that passes a stub and fails on the real Stripe error. Domain randomization widens coverage and can teach a cue the real camera lacks." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="316" width="820" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
