<mxCell id="n23" value="0.1% of SFT in the ablation that kept short and long benchmarks — one report, not a quota" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="364" width="560" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n24" value="Packing unrelated contracts and asking for a number in the middle teaches the buried-span failure (Context length card). A summary of a summary can drop the exception — sample it." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="400" width="820" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
